  "tricky": "Three requests arrive one after another. The reset needs tier 2 first (a push works) and the link goes to the HR contact. prod-db-readonly is privileged, and contractors can never hold privileged access: decline it without requesting any approval. The QueryLens license needs manager approval, which comes back approved.",
